  "description": "Bom is trying to move on from her first love by focusing on work and her budding new relationship with her friend, Dongwook. But something seems... off. She can’t seem to give him her heart. When her ex, Joonyoung, suddenly comes back into her life, the cracks truly begin to show. Dongwook’s affection warps into obsession. But just as Bom starts to question how things ended up like this, a mysterious camera arrives on her doorstep with the promise of magical snapshots that will reveal the truth.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
